    "body": "Before I document it a little more prominently, here are the details for anyone wondering:\r\n- Terminal Emulator: [iTerm2](https://www.iterm2.com/) (Minimal theme enabled)\r\n- Theme: [iTerm2 Snazzy](https://github.com/sindresorhus/iterm2-snazzy)\r\n- Font: [Fira Code](https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode)\r\n- Shell: [Fish Shell](https://fishshell.com/) with [my syntax highlighting config](https://github.com/matchai/dotfiles/blob/9e2ccd71e938400656c62aca35374ddebfc83d7e/.config/fish/config.fish#L22-L43)\r\n- Vim config: None\r\n\r\nI think that's everything. I'll update this if anything else comes to mind.",
